    <!-- Onboarding slides (T5). Previously hardcoded Kotlin/Swift literals;
         the localization gate only matches Text(...) so none of this was
         visible to it. Every slide reinforces one idea: CruiseMesh uses
         virtually every connection the phone has, and each permission line
